{"ID":"20240206112218-019nb30","Spec":"1","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240206112218-019nb30","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240206112218-019nb30\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240206112228-5tx7n73\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240221193639-58lpnj0\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:797,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240221193639-58lpnj0\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:4,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:4\u0026#125;","title":"鸡冠花","type":"doc","updated":"20240903092625"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240206112228-5tx7n73","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240206112228-5tx7n73","updated":"20240206112231"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【产地】\t原产非洲，美洲热带和印度，现全国大部分地区有栽培。\n【性状】\t本品为穗状花序，多扁平而肥厚，呈鸡冠状。长825cm，宽520cm，最大直径40cm。上缘宽，具皱褶，密生线状鳞片，下端渐窄，常残留扁平的茎。表面红色、紫红色或黄白色；中部以下密生多数小花，每花宿存的苞片及花被片均呈膜质。果实盖裂，种子扁圆肾形，黑色，有光泽。体轻，质柔韧。无臭，味淡。\n【性味】\t甘、涩，微寒。\n【功效】\t收敛止血，止带，止痢。用于吐血，崩漏，便血，痔血，赤白带下，久痢不止。"}]},{"ID":"20240206112221-l9x2lvd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240206112221-l9x2lvd","updated":"20240206112221"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240206112221-6pue8d3.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240221193639-58lpnj0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240221193639-58lpnj0","updated":"20240730135639"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 438px;","style":"width: 428px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240221193639-bj5pixz.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 428px;\" parent-style=\"width: 438px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240730135832-0h5u1s6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240730135832-0h5u1s6","updated":"20240730141757"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 425px;","style":"width: 415px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"鸡冠花 (1)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/鸡冠花 1-20240730135832-7fqx0t6.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 415px;\" parent-style=\"width: 425px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 748px;","style":"width: 738px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"鸡冠花 (8)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/鸡冠花 8-20240730141734-0wpywww.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 738px;\" parent-style=\"width: 748px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240730141848-7tcwnwf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240730141848-7tcwnwf","updated":"20240730142614"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 671px;","style":"width: 661px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"鸡冠花 (9)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/鸡冠花 9-20240730141848-6uci144.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 661px;\" parent-style=\"width: 671px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span